# Hermes service environment (data/hermes/.env)
# Generated by ./hermes-stack setup from this template.
#
# Terminal / sandbox settings (TERMINAL_DOCKER_VOLUMES,
# TERMINAL_DOCKER_EXTRA_ARGS, ...) live in the shared data/.env so a fresh
# config.yaml never drops them and the later env_file in docker-compose.yml
# cannot override them with a stale list. Add service-specific overrides here.
